  "rdfs:comment": {
    "de": [
      "9-Loch-Kompaktplatz, Driving Range, Kleinfeldbereich, Golfschule.\r\nDas ganze Jahr über für alle geöffnet."
    ],
    "en": [
      "At the crossroads of Chambery, the Combe de Savoie and the Grésivaudan, the Golf des Marches is conveniently located and beautifully surrounded by mountain ranges : the Savoyarde (Massif des Bauges), the Granier (Massif de la Chartreuse) and the Chain of Belledonne.\r\nThe Golf des Marches, on a 6-hectare area, is meant to be simple, fun, convenient and accessible to all."
    ],
    "it": [
      "Percorso compatto a 9 buche, campo pratica, area per il gioco di precisione, scuola di golf.\r\nAperto tutto l'anno."
    ],
    "fr": [
      "Parcours compact 9 trous, practice, zone petit jeu, école de golf.\r\nOuvert à tous, toute l'année."
    ],
    "nl": [
      "Compacte 9-holes golfbaan, driving range, ruimte voor kleine spelletjes, golfschool.\r\nHet hele jaar geopend."
    ],
    "es": [
      "Campo compacto de 9 hoyos, campo de prácticas, zona de juego reducido, escuela de golf.\r\nAbierto todo el año."
    ]
  },
